{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t國家主席習近平將與美國總統特朗普舉行雙邊會談。中美俄三國元首之後會舉行歷史性會談。<br/>\n<br/>\n特朗普在亞太經合組織會議上說，期待與習近平和俄羅斯總統普京會晤。俄方認為，三方會談樹立起對話溝通的典範。中方昨日表示，三國元首將就事關全球和平的重要問題，深入交換意見。\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T04:43:52.052551+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T04:26:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T07:27:08.244719+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T04:37:24.994072+00:00","content_hash":"2ddb6eccad42a1091ad7a1642c099f1653650716c60b4841da373bf7f2178f0f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}